<!--
id: T08
name: Credits added
layout: personal
kind: transactional
sender: hi
category: account
topic: none
trigger: credits_granted
phase: 1
subject: {{ trigger.amount | default: "More" }} credits added to your account
preheader: They're in your balance now.
footer_reason: You're receiving this because the Hydrilla team added credits to your account.
optional: false
send_rule: direct admin grants only; claim-link claims do not send this, the user sees the result on screen
facts: bonus credits carry over (docs/PAYMENTS.md); confirm before stating it
data: name, amount, reason, balance
-->
<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>I've added {{ trigger.amount | default: "more" }} credits to your Hydrilla account{% if trigger.reason %}: {{ trigger.reason | default: "" | replace: "<", "&lt;" | replace: ">", "&gt;" }}{% endif %}.</mj-text>
<mj-raw>{% if trigger.balance %}</mj-raw>
<mj-text>Your balance is now {{ trigger.balance | default: 0 }} credits.</mj-text>
<mj-raw>{% endif %}</mj-raw>
<mj-text><a href="https://hydrilla.ai/app/studio">Open Studio</a></mj-text>
<mj-text>Tejesh Varma,<br />Head of Growth<br />Team Hydrilla AI</mj-text>
